{"seq":1,"slug":"why-rate-limiting","title":"为何限流：过载与稳定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/foundations/why-rate-limiting","wordCount":2075,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何限流-过载与稳定性\">为何限流：过载与稳定性</h1><p>凌晨三点，一个监控告警把你叫醒：某个核心服务的 P99 延迟从 50ms 涨到了 8 秒，错误率 40%，而 CPU 利用率只有 60%——机器明明没满，服务却几乎不可用。这是过载最典型也最违反直觉的现场：系统没有被「打死」，而是被「卡死」。要理解为什么会这样、为什么加机器常常救不回来，得先看清吞吐量与负载之间那条非线性的曲线。限流的全部正当性，都建立在这条曲线之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇的过载原理可以压缩成五个相互咬合的概念，后面各节都是它们的展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>过载是断崖不是平台</strong>：吞吐越过饱和点后不会停在高位等着排队，而是掉头下跌——客户端超时引发重试、服务器忙于处理没人要的僵尸请求，形成正反馈。</li>\n<li><strong>有效吞吐（goodput）</strong>：真正被客户端拿到的成功响应数；它与名义吞吐的分岔，就是拥塞崩溃的本质。</li>\n<li><strong>利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\lambda/\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：M/M/1 模型下平均响应时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = (1/\\mu)/(1-\\rho)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，延迟随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/(1-\\rho)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 爆炸式增长，这是断崖的数学根源。</li>\n<li><strong>扩容的两个盲区</strong>：扩容是分钟级而崩溃是秒级（时间问题），且常被下游共享瓶颈拖住（依赖问题），所以救不了正在雪崩的系统。</li>\n<li><strong>保护对象与角色</strong>：限流保护 CPU/线程、内存、下游配额、公平性四类资源，扮演入口防滥用、自我保护、下游节流、公平分配四种角色。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话串起来：<strong>过载之所以是断崖，是因为延迟在高利用率下非线性放大；限流的任务，就是把利用率锁在曲线峰值的左侧</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过载为何是断崖而非平台\">过载为何是断崖而非平台</h2><p>朴素的直觉认为，负载超过容量后，系统吞吐量会停在最大值这个「平台」上，多出来的请求排队等着就好。真实系统几乎从不这样。当到达速率超过服务速率，队列开始无界增长，每个请求在队列里等待的时间越来越长。问题在于：客户端通常带超时。当排队延迟超过客户端超时，客户端会放弃并重试——但服务器并不知道，它仍然在处理那些早已被放弃的「僵尸请求」，把宝贵的 CPU 花在没人要的结果上。</p>\n<p>这就形成了一个正反馈：有效吞吐（goodput，真正被客户端拿到的成功响应）随负载上升先到达峰值，然后不是持平，而是掉头向下。负载越高，服务器越忙于做无用功，goodput 越低，于是更多请求超时、更多重试涌入。这就是所谓的拥塞崩溃（congestion collapse）。下图刻画了这条曲线的三个区段。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[到达速率上升] --&gt; B{是否超过服务能力}&#10;  B --&gt;|未超过 健康区| C[goodput 随负载线性上升&lt;br/&gt;延迟稳定]&#10;  B --&gt;|接近饱和| D[goodput 见顶&lt;br/&gt;延迟开始抬升]&#10;  B --&gt;|持续超过 过载区| E[队列无界增长]&#10;  E --&gt; F[请求排队超过客户端超时]&#10;  F --&gt; G[客户端放弃并重试]&#10;  G --&gt; H[服务器处理僵尸请求&lt;br/&gt;做无用功]&#10;  H --&gt; I[goodput 掉头下跌]&#10;  I --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[到达速率上升] --&gt; B{是否超过服务能力}\n  B --&gt;|未超过 健康区| C[goodput 随负载线性上升&lt;br/&gt;延迟稳定]\n  B --&gt;|接近饱和| D[goodput 见顶&lt;br/&gt;延迟开始抬升]\n  B --&gt;|持续超过 过载区| E[队列无界增长]\n  E --&gt; F[请求排队超过客户端超时]\n  F --&gt; G[客户端放弃并重试]\n  G --&gt; H[服务器处理僵尸请求&lt;br/&gt;做无用功]\n  H --&gt; I[goodput 掉头下跌]\n  I --&gt; G</pre><p>关键认识：从 goodput 见顶到拥塞崩溃之间，没有一段安全的缓冲带。一旦越过峰值，系统会主动地、加速地把自己拖入崩溃。限流的目标，就是把系统牢牢锁在曲线峰值的左侧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用排队论给-过载-一个量\">用排队论给「过载」一个量</h2><p>把单个服务实例近似为一个 M/M/1 排队系统——请求按泊松过程到达、服务时间服从指数分布、单服务台。设到达速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、服务速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>，定义利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = \\lambda / \\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>。排队论给出平均响应时间（含排队与服务）的经典结果：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>μ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = \\frac{1}{\\mu - \\lambda} = \\frac{1/\\mu}{1 - \\rho}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个公式的杀伤力全在分母的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - \\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>，响应时间是基准服务时间的 2 倍；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span> 时是 10 倍；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.99</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho = 0.99</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span></span></span></span></span> 时是 100 倍；而当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，响应时间趋于无穷。也就是说，把利用率从 90% 推到 99%，吞吐只多了 10%，延迟却涨了 10 倍。这条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/(1-\\rho)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的曲线正是「断崖」的数学根源：在高利用率区间，极小的负载增量会引发巨大的延迟爆炸。</p>\n<p>下表给出利用率与延迟倍数的对应，直观说明为什么把目标利用率设在 70%–80% 而非 95% 才是稳健的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>利用率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>延迟倍数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/(1-\\rho)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0.50</td>\n<td>2×</td>\n<td>大量余量，抗突发能力强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.70</td>\n<td>3.3×</td>\n<td>常见的稳健目标区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.80</td>\n<td>5×</td>\n<td>仍可接受，余量收窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.90</td>\n<td>10×</td>\n<td>延迟已明显，突发即危险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.95</td>\n<td>20×</td>\n<td>临界，任何抖动都放大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.99</td>\n<td>100×</td>\n<td>实质过载，濒临崩溃</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>限流的本质，就是人为地把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 卡在一个让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span></span></span></span> 停留在安全区的水平上，宁可拒绝一部分请求，也不让利用率滑入分母趋零的死亡区间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么-加机器-常常救不了雪崩\">为什么「加机器」常常救不了雪崩</h2><p>面对过载，最自然的反应是扩容。但扩容在两种情况下失效。其一是时间问题：自动扩容从触发到新实例就绪通常要几十秒到几分钟，而拥塞崩溃在秒级就能完成。等新机器起来，老机器可能已经因为内存耗尽（堆积的请求队列吃光了堆）而 OOM 重启，重启又导致流量集中到剩余实例，进一步加剧过载——这就是连锁失效。</p>\n<p>其二是依赖问题：很多过载的根因不在被扩容的这一层，而在它身后的共享瓶颈，比如一个数据库、一个分布式锁、一个第三方 API。扩容应用层只会让更多实例同时去争抢那个唯一的瓶颈，把下游压得更狠。这正是为什么背压必须沿调用链一路传到源头才有意义（见 <a href=\"../backpressure/backpressure-principles\">背压原理与传播</a>），单点扩容解决不了链路级的拥塞。</p>\n<p>限流与扩容是互补而非替代：扩容提高的是曲线峰值的位置，限流保证的是无论峰值在哪都不越过它。一个只会扩容、不会限流的系统，等于一辆只有油门没有刹车的车。</p>\n<h2 id=\"限流要保护的四类资源与四种角色\">限流要保护的四类资源与四种角色</h2><p>限流并不是单一动作，它在不同位置保护不同资源、扮演不同角色。理解这种多样性，才能在系统里把限流放到对的地方。</p>\n<p>从被保护的资源看，常见有四类：CPU 与线程（防止计算饱和）、内存（防止队列与缓存把堆撑爆）、下游依赖配额（防止打爆数据库或第三方 API）、以及公平性资源（防止单个租户挤占共享容量）。从角色看，限流可以是入口的「防滥用闸门」、内部的「自我保护阀」、对下游的「礼貌性节流」、以及对多租户的「公平分配器」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  CLIENT[外部客户端] --&gt; GATE[入口限流&lt;br/&gt;防滥用 防 DDoS]&#10;  GATE --&gt; SVC[服务实例]&#10;  SVC --&gt; SELF[自我保护限流&lt;br/&gt;守住安全利用率]&#10;  SVC --&gt; FAIR[多租户公平限流&lt;br/&gt;防止单租户挤占]&#10;  SVC --&gt; DOWN[下游节流&lt;br/&gt;不打爆数据库/第三方]&#10;  DOWN --&gt; DB[(共享瓶颈资源)]\">flowchart TD\n  CLIENT[外部客户端] --&gt; GATE[入口限流&lt;br/&gt;防滥用 防 DDoS]\n  GATE --&gt; SVC[服务实例]\n  SVC --&gt; SELF[自我保护限流&lt;br/&gt;守住安全利用率]\n  SVC --&gt; FAIR[多租户公平限流&lt;br/&gt;防止单租户挤占]\n  SVC --&gt; DOWN[下游节流&lt;br/&gt;不打爆数据库/第三方]\n  DOWN --&gt; DB[(共享瓶颈资源)]</pre><p>这四种角色对应着本 hub 后续的不同章节：入口防滥用与公平分配主要在网关层实现（见 <a href=\"../distributed/api-gateway-throttling\">网关限流与配额</a>），自我保护的进阶形态是负载卸载（见 <a href=\"../distributed/load-shedding-priority\">负载卸载与优先级</a>），对下游的礼貌节流则离不开客户端的退避策略（见 <a href=\"../practice/client-retry-jitter\">客户端重试、退避与抖动</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>系统吞吐在越过饱和点后不是平台而是断崖：客户端超时引发重试、服务器处理僵尸请求做无用功，形成拥塞崩溃的正反馈。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M/M/1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">/1</span></span></span></span></span> 的响应时间公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = (1/\\mu)/(1-\\rho)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 揭示延迟随利用率呈 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/(1-\\rho)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 爆炸式增长，这是「断崖」的数学根源，也是把目标利用率定在 70%–80% 的依据。</li>\n<li>扩容受限于响应时间（秒级崩溃 vs 分钟级扩容）与共享瓶颈，常常救不了正在雪崩的系统；限流提供扩容无法替代的「刹车」。</li>\n<li>限流保护 CPU/线程、内存、下游配额、公平性四类资源，扮演入口防滥用、自我保护、下游节流、公平分配四种角色，分别落在本 hub 的不同章节。</li>\n<li>接下来要做的，是把「卡住利用率」这个目标变成可执行的算法——令牌桶、漏桶与窗口计数，见 <a href=\"token-leaky-bucket\">令牌桶与漏桶算法</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何限流：过载与稳定性","id":"为何限流-过载与稳定性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"过载为何是断崖而非平台","id":"过载为何是断崖而非平台"},{"level":2,"text":"用排队论给「过载」一个量","id":"用排队论给-过载-一个量"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么「加机器」常常救不了雪崩","id":"为什么-加机器-常常救不了雪崩"},{"level":2,"text":"限流要保护的四类资源与四种角色","id":"限流要保护的四类资源与四种角色"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"令牌桶与漏桶算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/rate-limiting-backpressure/foundations/token-leaky-bucket"}}